Sun Aug 30 18:32:50 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.2.0~git20251009.1ae85f0:
  * Support FUNcube Dongle Pro (V1.x) besides the Pro+
  * Expose bias-T and frequency (TCXO) correction via the Soapy API
  * mmap direct-buffer streaming and a selectable period
  * Detect devices against the current libhidapi-libusb path format
- Ship a pinned master snapshot: upstream last tagged 0.1.1 in 2019 and
  cuts no releases, while its own changelog calls master "Release 0.2.0
  (pending)"
- Drop SoapyFCDPP-add-missing-return.patch, fixed upstream
- Correct License to BSL-1.0; upstream SPDX headers and LICENSE_1_0.txt
  are Boost, never MIT, and the file is now installed as %license
- Adjust build dependencies:
  * Drop unused pkgconfig(libbladeRF); nothing references bladeRF
  * Replace libhidapi-devel with pkgconfig(hidapi-libusb), the only
    hidapi backend FindHIDAPI.cmake links
  * Require pkgconfig(SoapySDR) >= 0.8 to match the ABI-keyed module dir
  * Require cmake >= 3.5, the policy floor the build relies on
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tags and the empty %check, refresh the
  summary/description wording and the URL tag
- Explicitly require soapy-sdr: the automatic soname dependency pulls
  only libSoapySDR, so the module could be installed with no SoapySDR
  client - not even SoapySDRUtil - to reach it

